       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Subtract $ut$ to get $S-ut=\\frac{1}{2}at^2$. Multiplying by $2$ and dividing by $t^2$ gives $a=\\frac{2(S-ut)}{t^2}$."
